    {
      "id": "contemplative-synthesis",
      "label": {
        "en": "Grand synthesis of contemplative traditions with this theory",
        "zh": "把禅修传统与本理论做大统一综合"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "An attempted mapping of Buddhist, Daoist, and Śaivite models of mind onto a single framework. It failed its own adversarial review and is NOT published. What survived: the genuinely un-unifiable divergences between traditions (cultivation vs. liberation as terminal goals), and the one actionable residue — that their contribution is a first-person verification method (practice), not a map.",
        "zh": "一份试图把佛家、道家与湿婆派的心智模型映射到单一框架上的综合稿。它没能通过自己的对抗性评审,未发表。活下来的是:传统之间真实的、不可统一的分歧(以修养为终点,还是以解脱为终点),以及一条可操作的残余——它们的贡献是一套第一人称的验证方法(行),而不是一张图。"
      },
      "cognitiveState": "retired",
      "edges": [{ "relation": "falsifies", "target": "root" }]
    },

